/jax/blob/4718121efecb1f43b10c1bcfb1df4f9af725d989/jax/_src/sharding_impls.py#L716) class set the memory kind of the new sharding to the default memory kind. The intuitive behavior is to take the memory kind from the original sharding (similarly to what [`NamedSharding.with_spec`](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/blob/4718121efecb1f43b10c1bcfb1df4f9af725d989/jax/_src/sharding_impls.py#L386) does).\r\n\r\nRepro:\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\n\r\ndevice = jax.devices()[0]\r\nsharding = jax.sharding.PositionalSharding([device], memory_kind=\"pinned_host\")\r\nprint(\"Original memory kind:      \", sharding.memory_kind)\r\nreshaped = sharding.reshape((1, 1))\r\nprint(\"Memory kind after reshape: \", reshaped.memory_kind)\r\n```\r\n\r\nExpected output:\r\n```\r\nOriginal memory kind:       pinned_host\r\nMemory kind after reshape:  pinned_host\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhat we get instead:\r\n```\r\nOriginal memory kind:       pinned_host\r\nMemory kind after reshape:  device\r\n```\r\n\r\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\r\n\r\n```\r\njax:    0.4.39.dev20250102+57b21541a\r\njaxlib: 0.4.39.dev20250108\r\nnumpy:  1.26.4\r\npython: 3.12.3 (main, Nov  6 2024, 18:32:19) [GCC 13.2.0]\r\ndevice info: NVIDIA GH200 480GB-1, 1 local devices\"\r\nprocess_count: 1\r\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='...', release='6.5.0-1015-nvidia-64k', version='#15-Ubuntu SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Thu Apr 11 18:10:26 UTC 2024', machine='aarch64')\r\n\r\n\r\n$ nvidia-smi\r\nWed Jan  8 12:10:59 2025\r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| NVIDIA-SMI 550.78                 Driver Version: 550.78         CUDA Version: 12.6     |\r\n|-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\r\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\r\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\r\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\r\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\r\n|   0  NVIDIA GH200 480GB             On  |   00000009:01:00.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   39C    P0             91W /  900W |     548MiB /  97871MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                                         |                        |             Disabled |\r\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\r\n\r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| Processes:                                                                              |\r\n|  GPU   GI   CI        PID   Type   Process name                              GPU Memory |\r\n|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\r\n|=========================================================================================|\r\n|    0   N/A  N/A   4150939      C   python                                        540MiB |\r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n```","closed_at":"2025-01-09T00:03:10Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.g